1. As a customer,
I want to log in with my id and password
so that I can access my own accounts.

2. As a Banker,
I want to log in with my banker credentials
so that the system shows me administrative capabilities instead of customer's account view.

3. As a customer,
I want my password to be stored in encrypted form
so that my credentials are not exposed if the files are read directly.

4. As a customer,
I want my account locked for 1 minute after 3 failed login attemps
so that the person guessing my password repeatedly can not get in.

5. As a customer,
I want to know how long I have to wait after a lockout
so that I know when I try logging in again.

6. As a banker,
i want to create a new customer record with name and id
so that the customer can be recognized by the system and use it.

7. As a new customer,
I want to open a checking account, a saving account or both
so that I can choose the account type with my needs.

8.As a customer,
I want to deposit money into my checking, saving account, or someone else's account
so that my balance changed based on the funds I added.

9. As a customer,
I want to withdraw money from my checking or saving account,
so that I can access my funds when needed.

10. As a customer, I want to transfer money between my own checking and saving accounts
so that I can move my funds.

11. As a customer,
I want to transfer money to another customer's account
so that I can pay or send money to someone else.

12. As a customer,
i want my account deactivated after 2 overdrafts
so that repeated negative balance activity is contained

13. As a customer,
I want my account reactivated auto once my balance is positive and paid the outstanding fees
so that I can use the account without contacting the bank support team.

14. As a customer, I want every transaction recorded with its type, date, resulting balance
so that I have a record for the account activity.

15. As a customer,
I want to view a detailed statement with total balance and transaction list
so that I can review my account.

16. As a customer,
I want to filter my transaction by today, yesterday, last week, last 7 days, last month, last 30 days
so that I can quickly find activity from specific time.

17. As a customer,
I want to filter my transaction by custom date
so that I can look activity outside the standard periods.

18. As a customer,
I want each of my card to be limited with daily withdrawal
so that my spending stays within the limit boundaries of the card.

